                "11"
              ],
              "text": "* ULN2803A: 8 Darlington drivers (one channel = ULN2803A_CH, used 8 times).\n* One channel: input 2.7k -> Q1 -> Q2 (Darlington), 7.2k and 3k turn-off resistors,\n* and the clamp diode from the output to COM. Pin order: IN1..IN8, GND, COM, OUT1..OUT8.\n.subckt ULN2803A i1 i2 i3 i4 i5 i6 i7 i8 gnd com o1 o2 o3 o4 o5 o6 o7 o8\nX1 i1 o1 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX2 i2 o2 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX3 i3 o3 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX4 i4 o4 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX5 i5 o5 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX6 i6 o6 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX7 i7 o7 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\nX8 i8 o8 gnd com ULN2803A_CH\n.ends\n.subckt ULN2803A_CH in out gnd com\nRin in b1 2.7k\nRb1 b1 gnd 7.2k\nQ1 out b1 e1 QDRV1\nRb2 e1 gnd 3k\nQ2 out e1 gnd QDRV2\nDc out com DCLAMP\n.model QDRV1 NPN(IS=1e-12 BF=150 RB=10 RC=1 RE=0.5 VAF=80)\n.model QDRV2 NPN(IS=2e-12 BF=100 RB=2 RC=0.3 RE=1.7 VAF=80)\n.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-12 N=1.8 RS=1.3)\n.ends"
            }
          },
